    <csbo:scope xml:lang="en">Plate generation</csbo:scope>
    <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="en">Associate each plate's profile, thickness, reference plane, orientation and installation point using the drawings. Generate openings, bolts, welds and similar details when supported by the requested detail level and drawing evidence; leave them as missing items when information is absent.</owl:annotatedTarget>
