        <csbo:ruleAction xml:lang="en">Distinguish PrecastDeckPanel from CastInPlaceDeckPart and preserve actual subdivisions, joints and repeated-instance numbers. Do not merge them into one mass solely because they belong to the same overall deck.</csbo:ruleAction>
