    <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="en">Distinguish reference planes, signs, angular units and axis order for side-view or front-view projection angles and in-plane angles. Do not automatically equate the direction joining two cable reference points with the end tangent direction accounting for sag.</owl:annotatedTarget>
